OL,3,GNEWSASerial offender who stole #329,000
OL,4,Aworth of cars jailed for 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial offender who stole #329,000
OL,7,Fworth of cars among other offences has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for 10 years.
OL,10,FJohn Callaghan, who previously pled
OL,11,Fguilty to a total of 39 charges,
OL,12,Fappeared at the High Court in Glasgow,
OL,13,Fwhere he was also banned for life from
OL,14,Fdriving.
OL,16,FThe 28-year-old was involved in a
OL,17,Fcatalogue of high-end car thefts and
OL,18,Fbreak-ins across Edinburgh, the
OL,19,FLothians and Stirlingshire between 2024
OL,20,Fand 2025.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
