OL,3,GNEWSASerial offender who stole #329,000
OL,4,Aworth of cars jailed for 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was also linked to packages of drugs
OL,7,Fand phones being thrown over the wall
OL,8,Finto HMP Edinburgh. Lord Arthurson said
OL,9,Fthe public needed protecting from his
OL,10,Fcriminal behaviour.
